		line=1189,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030110"},
		line=1189,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After finishing with Kanami's swimming lesson, I return to my post at the student council.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Good work out there. Here, have a towel.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I offer her a straightforward thanks and take the towel.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Without her military uniform, Elsa looks for all the world like just an ordinary girl.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I say, where do you think you're looking?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Elsa moves to cover her chest with her arms.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wasn't looking at your chest, but I apologize if I made you uncomfortable.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maybe I should make myself scarce.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah, hey, it's fine! You don't have to leave on my account.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Elsa grabs me by the wrist.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I turn and find myself staring right into her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I-I'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"She hastily withdraws her hand.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nothing to apologize for.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah, you're right, but still...”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"She trails off, her eyes darting around restlessly.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah! Look, see that carrier right offshore?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Um, yeah?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We've talked plenty about it already.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“S-Still, the two of us are right at home talking about this sorta thing! C-C'mon, let's go take a closer look!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Elsa stomps off without me.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Besides being embarrassed to show off her body, it seems like she's not very used to contact with the opposite sex in general.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Well, I might as well go along with her.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"I immediately chase after her footsteps in the sand.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"For some time, the two of us meander along the surf's edge.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Even though we've come a fair distance already, the silhouette of the titanic aircraft carrier on the horizon looks no different than from where we started.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When will the Republic be content to lay down its arms?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Will you not be satisfied until you have the entire world in your grasp?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's only politicians and big business that want war.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Politicians need wars to keep up their approval ratings, and big business needs war to keep up their bottom line.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Telling it like it is, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But wasn't your justification supposed to be 'saving the people of the world from tyranny'?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm still fighting for that cause.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's why I proposed Operation Bellflower.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So you would betray your country to uphold your ideals? I sincerely admire that.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Despite her words, however, Elsa's shoulders remain slumped.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You seem hesitant.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Is it that obvious?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, it is.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How about some advice, from one soldier to another?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll work things out myself.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I... won't get anywhere unless I work things out myself.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Elsa murmurs quietly, staring out beyond the distant horizon.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's an admirable attitude.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In the end, people can only hold fast to that which they decide for themselves.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have faith that you will eventually find an object worthy of your fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fealty, huh...”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Her gaze never wavering from the faraway horizon, Elsa ruminates on the meaning of that word for some time.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I never knew what 'fealty' meant before, but thanks to you, I think I'm starting to understand it.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Can I interpret it as a cause which you've vowed to always face head-on, without any falsity in your heart?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, that's exactly it.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We warriors devote the full measure of our fealty to our lords.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But it's a common misunderstanding that fealty demands unconditional obedience to our lords, or that it requires us to lay down our lives if ever called upon.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Instead, it'd be more accurate to say that fealty means always questioning the depth of your devotion, and being able to stake your life on your answer.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I look forward to seeing what you devote your fealty to.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes. Thank you, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Elsa shows me a smile I've never seen before from her.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Unlike her usual perfect smile, it's a genuine smile from the heart.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Make no mistake; she and I are sworn enemies.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The day may come when I'll need to strike her down with my own two hands.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Even so, for this single, brief moment, I'm glad to share in this concord between two fellow soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How strange... I never thought I'd be talking about this with you of all people.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Because we ply the same trade?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Before I know it, our shoulders are practically touching each other as the surf gently laps at our feet.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hey, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Elsa turns to face me, a sincere expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"An enormous wave crests up behind her as she slowly parts her lips.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I want to be the sort of soldier you can...”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A break.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Listen to me.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, seriously, the wave is about to break.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"A chest-high wave crashes right into Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fwaaaaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa!?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"I immediately seize her hand and pull her toward me.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Th-Thanks...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Uh...”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I'd pulled her harder than intended and dragged her right into my arms.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's... er, a bigger problem...”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Elsa tilts her head in confusion.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let me apologize up front.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah?!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Likely carried away by the current, Elsa's swimsuit is absolutely nowhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aah... Aaaaaaaahhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Elsa pushes herself away from me at once, cradling her chest in a fluster.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Look the other way, dammit!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Orders received!”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Once again, I find myself gazing upon the aircraft carrier on the horizon.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"It seems I've been doing that quite a lot today.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That was an awfully long walk you two went on.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"After quite some time, Elsa eventually found and retrieved her swimsuit. Now that we've made our way back, Akari comes up to me.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How was your long-distance swim?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It sure wasn't easy; Inou didn't hold back at all! You warriors should have to compete in a category of your own...”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"I feel a disquieting presence looming behind me.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"It's sinister─no, downright murderous!",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"I unthinkingly heed my instincts screaming at me to sidestep.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wah!”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"A salvo of water whizzes right past me and hits Akari square in the face.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“*Cough, cough!* Th-The heck?!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Impressively done, warrior. You've got good instincts.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"I wheel around to find Elsa pointing a water gun in our direction.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Though, the object in her hands is no ordinary water gun.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"It's formidable enough that she has to hold it with both hands.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What the heck was that for?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh dear, what an unfortunate misfire. It happens, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You call that a misfire? You just shot at me out of nowhere!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We're just playing around here.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ready up, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Hotori hands me a water pistol.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm no good with firearms.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Err, I would not exactly call these firearms...”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Kotone, similarly “armed”, shows me a strained smile.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Would you care to join us as well?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Elsa cordially offers a water gun to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why not? Sounds like fun...”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Akari takes the water gun with a sly grin on her face.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"She couldn't make it any more obvious that she's hungry for revenge.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"As though to fan her flames even more, Elsa flashes her a provocative smirk.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, you're on my team, right?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Akari yanks me by the arm before even giving me a chance to reply.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm with Miyaguni, too.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Hotori forms up beside me to bolster my other flank.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Then I'll take Empress Hisui. Shiinoha-san, you're also coming with me.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“H-Hweh? You're choosing me?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“C-Can't we just talk things out peacefully?!”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"They're both already getting cold feet.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry, but I don't think those two are gonna be much help.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This one's in the bag!”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't let your guard down.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Kh...!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Elsa immediately cradles her water gun and runs for cover.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah! Come out and fight!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“A warrior without a blade is no match for me!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Elsa pops out from behind her cover to pump us full of water, and several piercing projectiles race towards us in rapid succession.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"...Are we sure that thing is really just a toy?",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Too slow!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Even still, Hotori dodges all of her shots like it's nothing.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"For a warrior capable of dodging even bullets, this is essentially child's play.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmm, not bad. But you'll never win if all you do is dodge!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"She takes aim and peppers us with more shots.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, fire at will!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Akari barks out orders as she simultaneously returns fire.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"But her shots whiz harmlessly past Elsa's head as she takes cover once again.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah, I'd love to! But how the heck do you shoot this thing?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Hotori seems totally confused about the water gun's mechanism.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"She's pulling the trigger over and over again, but no water is coming out.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You have to compress the air here first!”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Akari gives her some impromptu field training.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? Huh...? Like this?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No, no, right here!”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“R-Right... Haah!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hmm? Is it working now?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Of course not. You broke it.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Give it up. Hotori isn't gonna be any help.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's do this, Soujin! Our target is Elsa!”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's still basically two against one!”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Akari leaps forward and rushes straight towards Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait, Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"As Akari dives out from her cover, she's immediately hit from both sides.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“T-Tango down!”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah. I actually hit her.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Kanami and Kotone have her caught in a perfect crossfire.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“An ambush, huh? The enemy is no slouch.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"I can't help but be impressed by such a well-laid stratagem.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Pffwah...! Stop being impressed and help me!”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm? You got it!”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Akari looked like she was having fun getting sprayed down with water, so I unintentionally left her to her own devices.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry. Nothing personal.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Cold! How cold!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"The water must have been freshly drawn from the tap.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"I immediately drench the two pushover enemy combatants.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui & Kotone"},
			{
"“Aaaaahhh!” “Aaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"The two of them drop the guns and run away clutching their heads.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Shooting the Empress just like that? I thought you'd at least hesitate a little.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It would be an affront to approach any matter half-heartedly, even a mere game such as this. I am sure Her Majesty will forgive me.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm gonna get you back for this!”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That was your folly for misevaluating the threat that your enemy posed. Welcome to the army, honey!”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, stay out of this. Elsa is mine!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Akari challenges Elsa to a duel.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Think you can take me?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come and get some!”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hyaah!”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Pyah!”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"The two blindly fire their water guns at each other.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hmm... bikini babes frolicking about, soaking each other with water...”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Shino sagaciously strokes her chin as she takes in the sight of Akari and Elsa's pitched battle.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Say, Hotori? How 'bout doing your next concert in a swimsuit?”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Not happening.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We can give the audience water guns, and everyone'll shoot each other and get soaking wet...”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Now that sounds like it'd be real se... I mean, a real sellout.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Shot down at once.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Meanwhile, Akari and Elsa's shoot-out still hasn't been decided yet.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, you got this!”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do not lose to her, Akari-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"I never thought I'd get to see such a charming scene playing out before my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If someone saw these two for the first time, I bet they'd think they're nothing besides a pair of good friends.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't be ridiculous now.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our ambition has always been to defeat Okonogi and expel the Republic from the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It doesn't matter who the enemy is that stands in our way.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Hotori is right, of course.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"The quality of Elsa's character is entirely inconsequential─the separate paths we walk require us to fight each other.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"Such is the fate of all those who are born as warriors.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"This twinge of uncharacteristic sentimentality I felt must surely be because today was much more fun than I could have ever imagined.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Haah... I'm totally soaked.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Miyaguni-san wouldn't let up until I was absolutely drenched from head to toe.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Now where was that towel?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"I grope around for my towel, but it's nowhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Are you looking for this?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"I wipe off my face with the towel I'm handed before I think to check the owner of the voice.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Rochel...”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I see you've been fraternizing rather extensively with the Imperials.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“This is a school-sanctioned event.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What exactly is the problem with the student council president interacting with the student body?”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh, no, I love Imperial culture myself, so I wasn't intending to criticize you for it.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Just consider this a gentle reminder to not invite any unfortunate misunderstandings.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm well aware.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I see I've overstepped my bounds. Please forgive me.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"Rochel sinks into a flawless Imperial-style bow.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"It's an impressively backhanded show of respect.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Honestly, I still barely have a grasp on who this man Rochel truly is.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"His family background and personal history are entirely spotless.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"He's shown himself to be a highly competent officer, and\nhe's steadily risen through the ranks.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"There are even rumors that he was personally responsible for playing a major role in our successful invasion of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"At present, he's stationed in the former Warrior District and apparently hard at work developing cutting-edge weapons and equipment.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I do believe that your father would want you to act with a greater sense of responsibility.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yeah, I know.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I believe it would also be best to keep your disdain for the governor-general in moderation.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Why, he would be positively heartbroken otherwise.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Mind your own damn business.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You know, the governor-general thinks very highly of your abilities.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...How so?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"In spite of myself, I can't help but ask.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"How pathetic of me.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Ever since the war, you've taken impressive initiative in suppressing the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Your daring exploits that August remain fresh in the\ngovernor-general's mind, and many troops among the rank and file greatly admire you.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What a rare sight, for you to say anything nice about me.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even so, most of my achievements were arranged by the governor-general. I was just able to swoop in and take credit.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Why, that is entirely immaterial to what we're discussing.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Did you know your father is considering you as the next governor-general?”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My father wants me? Haha...”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Even if that's true, he must have some hidden agenda.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Well, whatever the reason, it certainly wouldn't hurt to be in charge of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"As governor-general, I'd be able to shape the country to my will.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“With that in mind, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"do take care",
{"/font"},
" how you conduct yourself moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"It's fine.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"I roughly throw the towel back at Rochel.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"My skin crawls at the thought of touching him directly.",
			},
		},
	},
